From 927aa28609399f4601bdd686b7535c4ed58a8c85 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EllisSK <ellissinclairkent@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:50:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Fit the JEI integration to JEI 19.64 again (Fossil Fuel)

The Fossil Fuel pack ships JEI 19.64.0.455 and NeoForge 21.1.252, so build
against those instead of JEI 19.70.0.469 and NeoForge 21.1.265 (#147).

The JEI integration from #147 compiles against JEI 19.64 except for one
call: SearchInputLayer#focus() only exists from JEI 19.70. Focus the
overlay's search field directly instead, through the IngredientListOverlay
accessor #147 removed (now a client mixin). Everything else #147 uses is
already in JEI 19.64: display overrides on IRecipeSlotDrawable,
IRecipeSlotDrawable#draw(GuiGraphics, boolean), IClickableIngredientFactory,
SearchInputLayer#clearFocus/hasKeyboardFocus, and the mixin targets
(RecipeGuiLogic's Optional#map in getVisibleRecipeLayoutsWithButtons,
RecipeLayoutBuilder#buildRecipeLayout, createShapelessIcon and
getRecipeTransferButtonPosition, RecipeLayout#drawOverlays).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ANhmTTN2DnJwHfcTLZjNKe
